# Google Analytics 4 measurement id.
#
# Unset (the default) means no GA4 tag is installed at all, so a local clone sends nothing to
# the production property. Copy this file to `.env.local` to enable it while developing:
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local   # then edit the value
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_, and only to client code, so keep
# measurement ids here and never secrets. Note that anything in VITE_* ships to the browser:
# this is an id, not a credential.
#
# For production, set VITE_GA_ID in the Vercel project environment. Note the id is baked in at
# build time, so a change requires a rebuild rather than just a redeploy of the same output.
VITE_GA_ID=G-MH02XQ9SP4
